anges":"Converted legacy glTF to glTF 2.0 with Cesium; rigid axis alignment and horizontal centering only. Original geometry, materials and paint retained. Added surface-following operator tail paint and unmodified identification-logo texture. Branding is illustrative, not a registration-specific livery.","license":"GPL-2.0","sourceFiles":["source/e170/e170.blend","source/e170/e170.zip"],"operator":"ETH"}}}